      "content": "i tried that. i went into a dark room and put on headphones but it doesn't help. the noise is still there, it's like it’s inside my brain. nothing actually works to make it stop. it just feels like it's never going to be actually quiet. i'm just so exhausted from trying to fight it all the time.",
